  "system": {
    "description": {
      "gm": "",
      "value": "<p><strong>Frequency </strong>Once per hour</p><hr><p>Some creatures you’ve consumed have remarkable healing properties, and your body has synthesized them together into a healing factor. You recover [[/r 10[healing]]] hit points. This increases to [[/r 15[healing]]] when you become a Master in Medicine, and [[/r 30[healing]]]when you become Legendary.</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">If you have prepared an anima spell with the Healing trait, when you or your allies successfully Treat your Wounds, they can do so without a healer’s tool kit, and the frequency of this ability resets.</p>"
